WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Start with your invited number. Choose Sign up to review a prefilled profile. Choose Log in to go straight to Dashboard. Both require your own OTP.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
1 / Vision. Review your existing pillars and choices. Use Add detail or Declare a change when available, then continue to Stats.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
2 / Stats. Check your details and edit what has changed. Save changes. Editing a verified field may reopen its verification.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
3 / Chemistry. Review your activity choices. Save chemistry, then Finish sign up. No need to type your profile from scratch.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Your Home, your next step. NEXT FOR YOU points to your next action. How it works stays near the top whenever you want a reminder.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Set your REACH filters. Review your preferences before the matches open. Matching works in both directions: each person must fit the other.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Match 1 opens. Open Week and review your first match. Express interest or Pass. A mutual choice is needed before planning together.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
M1 closes. Match 2 opens.. If you have not locked in, review Match 2. Your previous window closes as the next match opens.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.000
M2 closes. Match 3 opens.. Review Match 3 if you are still searching. M3 closes Wednesday at 18:00, when the Slots checkpoint begins.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Share your weekend Slots. After mutual lock-in, both complete alignment and availability. Breakfast 09:00, Lunch 13:00, Coffee 17:00, Dinner 19:30.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Choose a time you both offered. Save availability and select a real overlapping slot. Both partners must complete alignment before a plan can be created.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Complete the agreement together. Review the rules and make your own acknowledgements. Both partners must complete their steps. Beta face checks are simulated.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Review your date plan. Check the plan together. At minute 21, the shared clock jumps to the latest saved weekend date, rounded up if needed.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:10.000
After the date: Debrief. Share your flags, then decide what comes next. RC opens at Sunday 21:00 only if your lock-in has ended.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:30.000
The accelerated test advances every three minutes and stops at next Monday. Review the timetable. Your decisions, consent and signatures are never automated.
